o has other under construction and ready possession and sold out projects like Anshul Heights, Sudhanshu, Sambhav. The property prices in Walkeshwar are in the range of 66500 to 74000 for Outright for ready and under construction\n\n₹\n\n## Price vs Locality\n\n₹100,000\n\n/sqft · locality avg **₹120,000**\n\n17% below avg\n\n₹\n\n## Walkeshwar — resale, rent & yield\n\nResale\n\n₹71,969/sqft\n\nmedian · 19 listings\n\nRent\n\n₹195.2/sqft/mo\n\n2 BHK ~₹210,000/mo\n\nGross yield\n\n3.3%/yr\n\nrent vs resale value\n\nThis project is quoted around **₹100,000/sqft** — **39% above** resale here.\n\nFrom MPE live listings, last 18 months · [Mumbai price index ›](/mumbai-property-price-index)\n\n01\n\n## Possession Timeline\n\nProposed\n\nDec 2028\n\nStatus\n\nNew\n\n02\n\n## Unit Configurations (per MahaRERA)\n\nConfigurationCarpetIndicative Price\n\n2 BHK750 ft²₹7.5 Cr\n\n2.5 BHK914 ft²₹9.14 Cr\n\n4 BHK1,221 ft²₹12.21 Cr\n\n4 BHK Sale Duplex1,496 ft²₹14.96 Cr\n\nConfigurations & carpet per MahaRERA filing · indicative price = locality rate × carpet (not the developer's quote).\n\n[💬 Verify current inventory with an advisor](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20Sambhav%20(RERA%20P51900025024))\n\n03\n\n## RERA Trust Record\n\nMahaRERA No.\n\nP51900025024\n\nRegistered\n\n2021-09-08\n\nLitigation\n\nNo reported in source\n\nEscrow Bank\n\n—\n\nArchitect\n\nAakar Architects & Consultants\n\nTotal FSI\n\n4077\n\n04\n\n## Buildings · 1 Wing(s)\n\nSambhav43 floors · 13 units\n\n05\n\n## Land DNA · Genesis\n\n**Redevelopment / SRA / MHADA / MMRDA / Freehold** — provenance from MPE's verification layer. The genesis no portal shows.\n\n06\n\n## Location\n\n📍 Walkeshwar  \n18.947284217647460,72.794831967829140\n\n▸ Explore map & Street View — for verified buyers\n\n07\n\n## Promoter & Professionals\n\nHelictite Residency Private LimitedNA\n\n08\n\n## Availability & Pricing\n\nTypeCarpetPriceAvail\n\n3 BHK945 ft²₹9.45 Cr4\n\n4 BHK1